Industrial Fire Insurance
Protection of your investments in movable and immovable tangible assets
Insurance
Industrial Fire Insurance
The insurance provides maximum protection to Bulgarian and foreign legal entities that own or are responsible for large administrative facilities, large commercial complexes with manufacturing or non-manufacturing activities, who wish to secure their investments in movable and immovable tangible assets . The insurance amount for protection in manufacturing activities is over 255 000 EUR, and for non-manufacturing activities – over 511 000 EUR. In the case of mortgaged or pledged property, the insurance may also be taken out in favor of DSK Bank.
What are the advantages?
Possibility for assuming big industrial risks and insurance liabilities;
Wide range of optional insurance covers;
Convenient deferment of premiums for no extra costs;
Reduction of insurance premium via the option for Insured person’s deductible;
Option for payment of premium via direct debit;
The insurance covers events that have occurred on the territory of the Republic of Bulgaria.
What does the insurance cover?
Main cover:
Fire;
Lightning;
Explosion;
Implosion;
Collision or fall of piloted aircraft, its parts or cargo;
Costs for cleaning and salvage of property.
Optional covers (at customer’s choice):
Arson;
Natural disasters, flood, damage due to natural load of snow or ice;
Earthquake;
Water and steam leakage;
Water leakage from sprinkler installations;
Sliding or collapse of earth;
Damages due to underground water;
Breaking of glasses, shop windows, advertising signs and boards;
Malicious actions of third parties;
Damage due to sea waves;
Short circuit and/or current rush;
Shock/ sound wave;
Loss of rental income;
Burglary, robbery, vandalism;
Failure of machinery;
Interruption of operations;
Failure of loading and unloading machineries during loading and unloading works;
Declaration of Inventory clause.
How can you get the insurance?
Quick and easy at any DSK Bank office in the country
Information about the terms and conditions can be received at any office or by sending an inquiry

